{
 "type": "doc",
 "version": 1,
 "content": [
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 2,
    "localId": "4b7bf386b722"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "1. Description"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The Inventory Value report lets you look at what your stock was worth "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "as of",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " a chosen date. Whatever date you choose, it answers with the "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "day after",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " it. Always exactly one day out."
    }
   ],
   "attrs": {
    "localId": "12fa33abecc2"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "rule",
   "attrs": {
    "localId": "8f02dc665452"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 2,
    "localId": "bc516a393a3c"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "3. Steps to reproduce"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "No special data is needed."
    }
   ],
   "attrs": {
    "localId": "3a516b4c1f45"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "orderedList",
   "attrs": {
    "order": 1,
    "localId": "caedbe63f36d"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "attrs": {
      "localId": "c668b1c7d645"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Open the "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Inventory Value",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " report."
        }
       ],
       "attrs": {
        "localId": "bf21ca5005b7"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "attrs": {
      "localId": "a458b82a9385"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Set a date range that "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "ends yesterday",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " \u2014 3 August 2026 \u2014 and press "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Apply",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "."
        }
       ],
       "attrs": {
        "localId": "6c9dc21ff415"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "attrs": {
      "localId": "6c0d63a92117"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Look at the "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "\"As of\"",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " line just under the report title. It reads "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "08/04/2026",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " \u2014 "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "today",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "em"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " \u2014 not the 3 August you asked for."
        }
       ],
       "attrs": {
        "localId": "f66ebe175781"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "attrs": {
      "localId": "dcb2acc9b9b5"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Now set a range ending "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "31 July 2026",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " and press "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Apply",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": ". The \"As of\" line reads "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "08/01/2026",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "."
        }
       ],
       "attrs": {
        "localId": "0a4572fe6d6d"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "attrs": {
      "localId": "469ce1e572f9"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Try one more, ending "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "31 January 2026",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": ". It resolves to "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "02/01/2026",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "."
        }
       ],
       "attrs": {
        "localId": "42ca6a06e629"
       }
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "attrs": {
    "localId": "a9a9ac3c48cc"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 2,
    "localId": "8229cabba557"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "4. Expected behaviour"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The written requirement (Inventory Value specification, version 3) says three things, and the report breaks all three:"
    }
   ],
   "attrs": {
    "localId": "c98a0662bf10"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "blockquote",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "\""
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "S5-R2:",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " The report values inventory "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "as of the end",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " of the selected range.\""
      }
     ],
     "attrs": {
      "localId": "68bb8a7bd53f"
     }
    }
   ],
   "attrs": {
    "localId": "26bb8621a16d"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "blockquote",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "\""
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "S5-R4:",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " Otherwise, the report replays the closest recorded day "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "on or before",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " the end of the selected range.\""
      }
     ],
     "attrs": {
      "localId": "b8cef0d57394"
     }
    }
   ],
   "attrs": {
    "localId": "a671d58cd371"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "blockquote",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "\""
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "S5-R7:",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " A Custom range lets the user pick a start and end date; the report values as of the picked end date (never a future date \u2014 it is capped at today).\""
      }
     ],
     "attrs": {
      "localId": "1421a8ce4f22"
     }
    }
   ],
   "attrs": {
    "localId": "4a3736696e6a"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "S5-R4 is broken twice over:",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " the day shown is not the end of the range, and it is not "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "on or before",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "em"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " it either \u2014 it is "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "after",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " it, which the requirement expressly forbids."
    }
   ],
   "attrs": {
    "localId": "667c00f77a44"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "(One thing does work correctly, worth saying so: asking for a date in the future is properly capped back to today.)",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "em"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "attrs": {
    "localId": "4014d986d41c"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "rule",
   "attrs": {
    "localId": "1a47bdab563d"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 2,
    "localId": "f62e8b50a0f7"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "6. Images"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "mediaSingle",
   "attrs": {
    "width": 921,
    "widthType": "pixel",
    "localId": "e407f4989a3c",
    "layout": "align-start"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "media",
     "attrs": {
      "type": "file",
      "id": "22fd1dc5-c4f8-410b-998a-ec8c2dfcc60b",
      "alt": "image-20260804-063045.png",
      "collection": "",
      "localId": "f95a9621d496",
      "height": 641,
      "width": 1525
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "mediaSingle",
   "attrs": {
    "width": 921,
    "widthType": "pixel",
    "localId": "68d1994067c3",
    "layout": "align-start"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "media",
     "attrs": {
      "type": "file",
      "id": "80bf7126-7184-44b7-8a0c-1f269f4f8f16",
      "alt": "image-20260804-063240.png",
      "collection": "",
      "localId": "48f89514b3df",
      "height": 532,
      "width": 1383
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "attrs": {
    "localId": "b85e2bafd8ce"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "rule",
   "attrs": {
    "localId": "62d7e3080ef2"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 2,
    "localId": "e6f7d724baa0"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "7. Technical details for developers"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3,
    "localId": "d561542ec403"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The exact request and the exact response field"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The resolved date is returned as "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "data.as_of_date",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "code"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " on the report payload ("
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "GET /api/reporting/reports/inventory-value",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "code"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": ", alongside "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "collection",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "code"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": ", "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "pagination",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "code"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " and "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "totals",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "code"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": ")."
    }
   ],
   "attrs": {
    "localId": "d0912e2bb4cb"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "codeBlock",
   "attrs": {
    "localId": "063492bd76ea"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "GET \u2026/inventory-value?range=custom&start_date=2026-08-03&end_date=2026-08-03&locations=<HD>\n -> 200   data.as_of_date = \"2026-08-04\"    asked 08-03  \u2717   rows 5657  totals.total_cost 48554218\n\nGET \u2026/inventory-value?range=custom&start_date=2026-07-01&end_date=2026-07-31&locations=<HD>\n -> 200   data.as_of_date = \"2026-08-01\"    asked 07-31  \u2717   rows 5657  totals.total_cost 48554966\n\nGET \u2026/inventory-value?range=custom&start_date=2026-01-01&end_date=2026-01-31&locations=<HD>\n -> 200   data.as_of_date = \"2026-02-01\"    asked 01-31  \u2717   rows 0\n\nGET \u2026/inventory-value?range=custom&start_date=2020-01-01&end_date=2020-01-31&locations=<HD>\n -> 200   data.as_of_date = \"2020-02-01\"    asked 01-31  \u2717   rows 0\n\nGET \u2026/inventory-value?range=custom&start_date=2026-08-04&end_date=2026-08-04&locations=<HD>\n -> 200   data.as_of_date = \"2026-08-04\"    asked 08-04  \u2014 shift MASKED (it lands on today)\n\nGET \u2026/inventory-value?range=custom&start_date=2027-01-01&end_date=2027-01-31&locations=<HD>\n -> 200   data.as_of_date = \"2026-08-04\"    future correctly capped to today   \u2705\n\nGET \u2026/inventory-value?locations=<HD>            (no range parameter at all)\n -> 200   data.as_of_date = \"2026-08-04\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Eight of eight date probes shifted by exactly one day",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": ", plus "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "eleven more",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " in a separate boundary run, every one echoing "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "as_of_date 2026-08-04",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "code"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " for "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "end_date=2026-08-04",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "code"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "."
    }
   ],
   "attrs": {
    "localId": "74a638611f56"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3,
    "localId": "4a9a601c01d1"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Two facts that pin down what it is and is not"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "orderedList",
   "attrs": {
    "order": 1,
    "localId": "10c5e5aed3ce"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "attrs": {
      "localId": "b29e3ed39b8b"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Stored history IS being served, correctly, and the shift sits on top of it.",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " The 31 July request returned "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "total_cost",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "code"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "48554966",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " ($485,549.66) where today's live figure is "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "48554218",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " ($485,542.18). Two different real numbers \u2014 so a snapshot lookup is genuinely happening; it is looking up the wrong day."
        }
       ],
       "attrs": {
        "localId": "614b86dd994b"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "attrs": {
      "localId": "8e270c26da12"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "The shift is applied outside the history window entirely.",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " A 2020 request \u2014 years before any capture \u2014 still returns "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "2020-02-01",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "code"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": ". So this is arithmetic on the requested date, not a lookup that happens to land one day out."
        }
       ],
       "attrs": {
        "localId": "9445f1e6fcf8"
       }
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3,
    "localId": "eff932e7a06c"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Knock-on effect on S5-R5 / S5-R6"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "blockquote",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "S5-R6:",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "\"When the displayed day matches the date asked for (the common current-view case), the \"As of\" indicator is \u00011\u0001 shown.\"",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "em"
        }
       ]
      }
     ],
     "attrs": {
      "localId": "a06d3fa978db"
     }
    }
   ],
   "attrs": {
    "localId": "d28e3ede1301"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The indicator is "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "always",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " shown \u2014 on the default view (This Month, ending today, values representing today) the page renders "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "As of 08/04/2026",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "code"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " immediately after the report title. And because the resolution can never land "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "earlier",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "em"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " than the requested date, the one condition the indicator exists for (S5-R5) "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "cannot be produced at all",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "."
    }
   ],
   "attrs": {
    "localId": "68cad9ce5137"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3,
    "localId": "135b55997d38"
   },
