   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Where this expected behaviour comes from: the Inventory Value report specification, version 4, requirement S5-R2, which says: \"The report values inventory as of the end of the selected range.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The same specification, requirement S5-R7, says of a custom range: \"A Custom range lets the user pick a start and end date; the report values as of the picked end date (never a future date \u2014 it is capped at today).\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "And requirement S5-R4 gives the only permitted fallback, which is backwards and never forwards: \"Otherwise, the report replays the closest recorded day on or before the end of the selected range.\" A day AFTER the date asked for is not an outcome the specification allows."
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
